# Apply after 0001-support-asus-b550m-plus-wifi-rtx3070ti.patch on upstream f33a4c8.
# Adds two compile-time switches, both driven by build.ps1:
#   -Silent   -> -DGU_SILENT_LOCK -DGU_AUTO_ARM : no log file, no console echo,
#                single "Unlocking" banner, no key prompt (release image).
#   -AutoArm  -> -DGU_AUTO_ARM                 : every log line kept, still no key prompt.
# Without either switch the original manual-U behaviour is unchanged.

